{"assignees":[],"author":{"id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0NTgzMjM2","is_bot":false,"login":"GautamKumarOffical","name":"Gautam Kumar"},"body":"**Bounty:** $30 (LT)\n**Area:** tools/pre-commit, Makefile, docs/pre-commit-hook.md\n**Current state:** A pre-commit hook has been added that automatically runs diagnostic generation before every commit. It checks for changes, runs python3 build.py, stages diagnostic artifacts, and aborts on failure.\n**What's needed:** This issue tracks the completed pre-commit hook feature for the cross-repo bounty tracker.\n**Acceptance criteria:**\n- [x] Pre-commit hook script that runs python3 build.py\n- [x] Checks for changes to skip unnecessary rebuilds\n- [x] Stages diagnostic artifacts automatically\n- [x] Aborts commit on build failure\n- [x] Makefile with install-hooks target\n- [x] Documentation in docs/pre-commit-hook.md\n**Required validation:**\n- Run `python3 build.py`\n- Include the generated diagnostic `.logd` artifact from `diagnostic/build-XXX.logd` in the PR; also include `diagnostic/build-XXX.json` if present\n- Use `.github/pull_request_template.md` for your submission","comments":[{"id":"IC_kwDOS84uec8AAAABGxNb4A","author":{"login":"Errordog2"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #3\n\nSubmitted PR: https://github.com/GautamKumarOffical/zeroeye/pull/6\n\nImplemented the diagnostic pre-commit hook bounty with:\n- `tools/pre-commit` running `build.py` for staged changes and aborting on failure\n- automatic staging for `diagnostic/build-*.logd`, `diagnostic/build-*.json`, and `diagnostic/build-*-metadata.json`\n- `make install-hooks` target\n- `docs/pre-commit-hook.md` install and smoke-test docs\n\nValidation:\n- `wsl sh -n tools/pre-commit` passed\n- `build.py --module market` was attempted; local Windows runner lacks Go and `.logd` finalization failed, captured in `diagnostic/build-00000000.json`","createdAt":"2026-06-19T06:55:05Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/GautamKumarOffical/zeroeye/issues/3#issuecomment-4749220832","viewerDidAuthor":false}],"createdAt":"2026-06-19T06:09:36Z","labels":[],"state":"OPEN","title":"[$30 BOUNTY] [Python] Pre-commit hook for diagnostic generation","updatedAt":"2026-06-19T06:55:05Z","url":"https://github.com/GautamKumarOffical/zeroeye/issues/3"}
